  id: spell-detect-magic
  displayName: Detect Magic
  description: For the duration (up to 10 minutes, concentration), you sense the presence of magic within 30 feet of you, and can use your action to see a faint aura around a visible magical creature or object and learn its school of magic. Can be cast as a ritual (not modeled -- no ritual-casting mechanism yet). Pure utility -- no mechanical effect authored.
